  "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nHi PX4 Maintainers,\n\nAbout two weeks ago, I submitted two potential security vulnerabilities through the GitHub Security Advisories page, but I haven't received any confirmation or follow-up yet.\n\nI just want to make sure the reports were received. If needed, I'm happy to resubmit or provide more information through the appropriate channel.\n\nThank you for your attention and your great work on PX4.\n\nBest regards\n0x20z",
